{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13201060","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13201060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1320106001:0":{"text":"Hmm... Well, it's very abstract...","source_cn":"唔……这画得好抽象啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7807845BE3F3D2D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320106002:1":{"text":"Is it... some kind of food? Doesn't really look like it.","source_cn":"这是……一种食物吗？也不像啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FEF1BED47005DD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320106003:0":{"text":"ROAR!","source_cn":"嗷——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6629E8D17D24A465","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320106004:0":{"text":"No, no... Look, it's shaking its head.","source_cn":"不对不对，你看叶角熊都摇头了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04337D8B1EF95171","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320106005:1":{"text":"Look from this angle, see? It's an arrow... pointing in that direction! Hmm... I seem to remember there being a hornleaf bear den over there...","source_cn":"这个角度，看！我觉得——是个指向那边的箭头。唔，我记得...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD76AA7CCBE3490E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320106006:0":{"text":"ROAR!","source_cn":"嗷！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x206C389DFA4688BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320106007:1":{"text":"Okay, I got it. You want to find your way home! You must be lost!","source_cn":"明白了，原来你想回家呀！你一定是迷路了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B0A9EC6ECC00582","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320106008:1":{"text":"There's not much food around this time of year either, so you must be starving. Poor old hornleaf bear...","source_cn":"这样的天气也没什么食物，你肯定挨饿了，可怜的叶角熊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE465D71B2833D861","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320106009:1":{"text":"Chippy didn't think it could be so smart, trying to communicate with us like that.","source_cn":"没想到它这么聪明，在尝试用这种方式和我们交流。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC95759456575279A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320106010:1":{"text":"How do we get it back to its den, Magister?","source_cn":"主人，我们该怎么把它送回熊窝呀？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x37AEA887EEB9FF45","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_targ